CO2Fix_3_1

120	# simulation lenght [yr]

comments
{
Teak (Tectona grandis ) plantation in the tropics (data from Costa Rica)
MAI 15 m3/ha/yr over 40 years
Rotation 40 years; thinnings at ages 3, 10, 20, and 30 years.

CASFOR Case Study by Markku Kanninen and Álvaro Vallejo, CATIE, 2004.

Growth data from:
Pérez Cordero, L.D.; Ugalde Arias, L.; Kanninen, M.  
Desarrollo de escenarios de crecimiento para plantaciones de teca (Tectona grandis) en Costa Rica.  
Revista Forestal Centroamericana (CATIE). (Jul-Set 2000). (no.31) p. 16-22.  

Volume data from:
Pérez Cordero, Luis Diego; Kanninen, Markku. 2003. Provisional equations for estimating total and merchantable volume of Tectona Grandis trees in Costa Rica. Forests, Trees and Livelihoods, 2003. Vol. 13, pp. 345-359.

Financial data from:
Puolakka, Pekka, 2003. Profitability of teak in Costa Rica. MSc Thesis, University of Helsinki. 78 pp.

}

1	# number of Scenarios

0	# mitigation scenario
0	# baseline scenario

0	# Project duration
0	 #Year of first verification

0	# Base year (or start of crediting period)

0	# NetNet year, year in which base emissions or removals are measured

1	# No Baseline
0	# Exclude products
1	# Exclude bioenergy
0	# Mitigation method (i.e. JI, CDM etc....)
1	# Assist 1 result
0	# Assist 2 result
7	# Carbon selected for comparison between baseline and mitigation scenario (i.e. biomass, soil, total etc..)
